  "releaseNotes": "Fixed StreamEvents.ReduceAsync leaving an empty TextBlock in a settled Message when a stream is cut (e.g. a dropped connection) right after content_block_start but before any text delta arrives. Previously only thinking blocks were guarded against this; an empty text block passed through unfiltered, and once persisted it permanently broke the conversation because Anthropic rejects empty text content blocks on every subsequent request. Text blocks with partial content are still kept as before — only a block with zero text received is dropped.",
